{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Castor enters and listens to coppers convo","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:47:39.313000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738286672021553294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Thank you.” He thinks for a moment, “I know you judged people’s hearts when they join, but do you ever judge people after they’ve joined?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:48:05.674000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738286782587732070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Yes.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:49:15.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287075731701761","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"It falls to me to watch them and judge them if they are worthy of a title. Some may need to talk to Excalibur once more\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:49:47.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287209605627924","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I am, how you say, the first gate\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:50:30.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287389260382218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"And the watcher\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:50:34.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287405773094934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Excalibur is the inner gate that judges truth\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:50:46.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287457455439954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Has anyone ever tricked Excalibur?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:52:04.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287783696793672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"It's power is unable to be deceived. It is divine power\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:52:26.997000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738287878655967233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
