{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper nods, “has anyone ever betrayed the knights, after they joined? For instance, did there hearts change?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:53:56.177000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738288252703998003","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Yes, but each symbol is able to tell when one of our own breaks from our oath. The divine power that grows with our oaths in our Knight regalia is linked to our faith. If one was to break its trust, it would immediately break and deny them access to our hollowed grounds\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:55:53.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738288745022750821","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"You may have seen something happen to Wynne when horns appeared. It has since been repaired, but for a night they had lost the divine power of their oath. They talked to Excalibur and all was made right\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:57:02.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738289035025448991","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper nods, “a few friends of mine seem to think that the knights are infallible. That there isn’t a chance a traitor could hide within the order. However, I personally am unsure of this.” Copper looks to Florian, “do you think them right, and that my worries are unfounded? Or... do you think there is there some truth to my, hesitation?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:59:34.302000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738289670902775889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I think that in this time, people will see this threat everywhere. The trust of the people has been broken\"\n\n\"I know what the Knights can do. We are bound and held accountable wherever we are, and I can trust that with more than just my life, but the lives of everyone here\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:08:29.293000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738291914817929236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper nods, he thinks on something. “the Knights and the Masons, two separate organizations, who’s leaders are close friends. They aren’t that different, are they?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:12:05.644000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738292822259662988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Or am I just rambling?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:12:13.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738292854849273966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"We have some fundamental differences and secrets. Archivist is ma chere amis, and I will always hold him as such and defend him with all that's left of me if need be. But we operate differently and hold different goals\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:13:46.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738293244349382667","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
